theme = ExtResource("3_mtvw0")
text = "Our company motto is,
\"Trust Not, Fear Not, Fail Not.\" 
Good reasons for wanting to join our company follow it, or follow our mission statement,
\"Encourage orderly game-design and a disciplined workplace.\"

Avoid applicants who may be sent by certain agencies:
Asked To, Untrustworthy"
